  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$If points P(-2,3) and Q(5,7) are midpoints of segments AB and BC respectively, then A and C must lie on a straight line.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Given point L at (0,4), its reflection over the x-axis is M(0,-4).$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The points N(-3, -2) and O(1, 5) have their midpoint at (-1, -1.5).$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$If point W at (0,-3) is reflected over the x-axis to X, then WX would be a horizontal line segment.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$For points V(2,6) and U(-4,-2), their reflection across both axes combined will place them in Quadrant II.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Point Z at (3, -1) has its reflection over the y-axis as Z' at (-3, 1).$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In Fig. 1.7, triangle ADM is reflected over the y-axis to create triangle A'M'D'.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The coordinates of point D' after reflecting ΔADM over the x-axis are (–3, 1).$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The distance AD in Fig. 1.6 can be calculated as √(2² + 4²) units.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Reflecting triangle ADM across the y-axis results in a triangle with coordinates A'(-9, -6), M'(-3, -1), and D'(7, -1).$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '4740c507-d810-40b8-934c-5fe8df821f3c', '8ece99ec-653f-496b-9fe5-0fb9700be044', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$If ΔADM is reflected over the x-axis, the length of AD will be 5 units.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-27-714Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
